WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.919
(Alarm sounds)

00:00:01.919 --> 00:00:04.296
James:
I never wanted this for you.

00:00:04.296 --> 00:00:05.964
♪♪

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:08.467
I wanted a totally different
life.

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:11.011
James:
A steady paycheck,

00:00:11.929 --> 00:00:12.804
James:
kids,

00:00:13.931 --> 00:00:14.890
James:
a family.

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:20.062
♪♪

00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:22.356
Dad, tell me there's a way out
of this?

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.775
James:
Not a quick one.

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:29.529
♪♪

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:32.950
We would like you to transfer to
another prison and befriend
someone.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:35.035
Lauren:
To elicit a confession.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:40.332
♪♪

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:42.542
We suspect that this man killed
14 women.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.503
But we only have one of the
bodies.

00:00:44.503 --> 00:00:48.465
♪♪

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:50.217
Larry has vivid dreams.

00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:51.385
Tell me about them.

00:00:51.385 --> 00:00:54.221
In my dreams, I kill woman.

00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:55.722
♪♪

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.974
Larry:
But they're just dreams.

00:00:56.974 --> 00:00:58.642
♪♪

00:00:58.642 --> 00:01:00.394
And this prison, where the
guy is?

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:03.730
Lauren:
Maximum security, specializing
in the criminally insane.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.484
♪♪

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:10.404
You want me to check into hell?

00:01:10.404 --> 00:01:11.321
James:
And befriend the demon?

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:14.866
Not for all the money in the
world.

00:01:15.659 --> 00:01:16.576
How about freedom?

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:21.415
♪♪

00:01:21.415 --> 00:01:22.958
Lauren:
Paul's conviction's on appeal.

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:25.252
Lauren:
He could win and walk.

00:01:25.669 --> 00:01:27.296
Lauren:
You have the chance to stop him.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:31.466
Lauren:
Don't approach him too early or
he'll  know we sent you for him.

00:01:31.466 --> 00:01:33.010
♪♪

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:34.511
Larry:
Why are you looking at me like
that?

00:01:35.053 --> 00:01:36.680
Like you know me.

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:40.058
♪♪

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:42.477
If it gets out that you're
here to snitch...

00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:43.228
♪♪

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:45.188
J. Cater:
...that's going to be a very
unfortunate day.

00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:46.523
♪♪

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:47.774
Lauren:
Accelerate your timetable.

00:01:48.317 --> 00:01:50.235
Lauren:
If he walks, he'll kill.

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:51.028
♪♪

00:01:51.028 --> 00:01:52.195
Lauren:
Again and again.

00:01:52.195 --> 00:02:00.996
♪♪

00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:03.290
Larry:
You think you could be in
danger,

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:05.751
you are in danger.

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:15.927
♪♪

